Package: scfigR
Title: NC-Style Single-Cell Figure Toolkit
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Jiang", family = "Congxin", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jcx981212@163.com")
Author: Jiang Congxin
Maintainer: Jiang Congxin <jcx981212@163.com>
Description: R tools for preparing and drawing single-cell atlas figures from source-data tables. Combines embeddings, sample-level cell fractions, marker expression, and module scores with shared cell-type colors and validated inputs.
